From: Apex ZMK port
Subject: [PATCH 0005] A/B auto-rollback promote (apex_pro_mini_wl only)

Add the bootloader half of A/B rollback. After three unhealthy boots it checks
the version-2 descriptor and staged CRC, restores image B only within
0x1000..0x72000, verifies the restored CRC, and clears the bootloader settings
page so normal vector validation can continue.

The full-size layout was validated on hardware on 2026-09-03. A 335,612-byte
image B survived a deliberately faulting app and was restored byte-for-byte;
UICR stayed unchanged and the recovered app staged itself again.

`ab_promote.c` and `ab_promote.h` are kept with the board port in this repository.
Copy them to the upstream bootloader's `src/` directory before applying patches.

